**Document Scope:** Cross-vertical forensic and technical comparison of **Endpoint OS Agent Containers & Windows Security / Firewall Boundary Controls** (per-session hardware-isolated runtime sandboxes paired with host firewall allow-listing, process/session telemetry, and local loopback runtime authority) against Spencer David Southern's **Mint-to Logic™** (`[100]`–`[600]`, April 15, 2025 drawings) and **The Shepherd's Method™ / Process** (December 19, 2024 filing baseline).

